2026-10-20T07:07:46.4555667Z PASS repo with .git DIR contributes each convention subdir it has
2026-10-20T07:07:46.4558837Z PASS a git WORKTREE (.git file) counts as a repo
2026-10-20T07:07:46.4559492Z PASS a directory WITHOUT .git is not a repo
2026-10-20T07:07:46.4560535Z PASS a repo without any listed subdir contributes nothing
2026-10-20T07:07:46.4561371Z PASS an excluded child NAME is skipped even when it is a repo
2026-10-20T07:07:46.4562068Z PASS a missing parent is skipped silently
2026-10-20T07:07:46.4562710Z PASS discovered roots are articles, and marked
2026-10-20T07:07:46.4585976Z PASS explicit + discovered are unioned
2026-10-20T07:07:46.4589030Z PASS a path in both appears once, keeping the explicit entry
2026-10-20T07:07:46.4593215Z PASS exclude is handed to the builder
2026-10-20T07:07:46.4595848Z PASS skipNames extends the built-in set, never replaces it
2026-10-20T07:07:46.4630310Z PASS no discover block = no discovery
2026-10-20T07:07:46.4632140Z PASS an existing sources.json is NOT rewritten with a discover block
2026-10-20T07:07:46.4642678Z PASS a malformed discover block degrades to defaults, never throws
2026-10-20T07:07:46.4708608Z PASS a freshly seeded sources.json carries the discover block
2026-10-20T07:07:46.4709523Z PASS seeding does not invent roots outside the literal list + wikis
